seq v=1 rig=screen program=claude build=2.1.0
# A late wake: the idle held past its settle, then busy: the idle's turn
# closes first, and the busy opens the next. Two exchanges, never one.
see busy
see idle
elapse
elapse
elapse
expect turn=t1
see busy
expect open t1 turn
expect close t1 turn out=done at=0
expect open t2 turn at=1500
expect turn=t2
